## Lineage
<!-- OPEN tier, append-only tables: never delete a row; supersede it. -->

The project's master index: every campaign and session, what changed, and what it found, in one
place. Archived campaigns stay listed. A resuming agent or colleague reads this first to find past
work; each row's `@key` links to its knowledge-base resource, and the *Verified findings* column
points into the campaign's own record (the `finding` cells of `results/scoreboard.tsv` + `results/verdicts/`), where
the evidence lives.

